OL,7,     Fhost at their Cambridgeshire
OL,8,     Fglampsite, where an extra jaunt to
OL,9,     Fget to the loos proves too much
OL,10,     Ffor one set of guests to handle.
OL,11,G1230 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FOnur and Yann host at their
OL,13,     Fhistoric, opulent hotel in
OL,14,     FSuffolk. But one set of guests
OL,15,     Fthink that a broken coffee machine
OL,16,     Fdoesn't add up to luxury.
OL,17,G1300 Four in a Bed
